  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By 2nd level, the fame and fortune of the rockstar is on the rise. When he saunters around town, his talent proceeds him. If he makes a Perform check (DC 15), the rockstar gains a bonus on Charisma based skill checks when interacting with people he meets who hear him and are aware of his fame. This circumstance bonus to the skill check is equal to 1/2 the rockstar’s level. The chance of someone knowing the rockstar is listed on the accompanying chart. Being recognized has its drawbacks, particularly if the rockstar is infamous. Checks by anyone made to identify the rockstar with Knowledge (local) gains a +4 bonus.</p>\n<strong>Table: Idol Rockstar</strong>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Level</th>\n<th>% Chance of Being Recognized</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-5th</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6-10th</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11-15th</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-19th</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20th</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-rockstar#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
